	(text "THERMAL RELIEF PLAN (F-9, for layout): pads 85-112 are the central thermal/ground lattice - stitch every one straight down to the L2 solid GND plane with its own via (no thermal spokes, solid connection). Pad 76 is the local audio ground and pads 46/48/50/51 are the RF ground fence flanking ANT_GNSS(47)/ANT_MAIN(49) - fence pads get >=2 vias each, placed to keep the CPWG return path continuous. Perimeter grounds 8/9/19/22/36/52/53/54/56/72 get >=1 via each."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
