	(text "USIM: 33R series on DATA/CLK/RST, 100nF on VDD, SMF05C at the holder. MFF2 eSIM pads (X2, DNP) parallel; VDD via 0R selects R69 (fitted, holder) / R70 (DNP, eSIM). SMF05C pin2=GND to be confirmed at footprint verification."
